Package: tiny-pomodoro-xfce
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gio Guarino <gioguarino@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: 67
Depends: python3:any, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, libnotify-bin, pulseaudio-utils, xfconf
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/guarinogio/tiny-pomodoro-xfce
Description: Small floating Pomodoro and countdown timer for XFCE
 Tiny Pomodoro XFCE is a small floating GTK timer for Xubuntu/XFCE.
 It supports Pomodoro mode, countdown timer mode, notifications,
 dark mode, autostart, and optional shutdown scheduling.
